  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries and place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat and roast until golden, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6515154b1f7307dd304ae41a-a72743d0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a medium bowl, combine black beans, Cheddar cheese, spicy taco seasoning, the plain flour, egg and milk. SPICY! Use less seasoning if you're sensitive to heat! Season with a pinch of salt and mix well to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6515154b1f7307dd304ae41a-20d2f4c4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of fritter mixture in batches and flatten with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 mins each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 2-3 fritters per person.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6515154b1f7307dd304ae41a-b58f3a42.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve burger buns then place directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• Thinly slice tomato into rounds.\n• Spread bun bases with some smokey aioli. Top with salad leaves, tomato and Mexican black bean fritters.\n• Serve with fries and remaining smokey aioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6515154b1f7307dd304ae41a-bc197c28.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
